    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideal opportunity to acquire this charming two bedroom, two bathroom street scope townhouse conveniently located on the Bandon Road end of the Lough Road. \r\n\r\nOnly a short walk from Cork City Centre, UCC and Bons Secours Hospital.\r\n\r\nThe property is in excellent condition throughout with good quality fixtures and fittings, will make an excellent starter home or investment property alike.\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating and enclosed elevated south facing garden to rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES;\r\n\r\nReception Hall L2;\r\nSolid oak floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 11’5’ x 9’5’; \r\nFireplace (Gas fire).\r\nSolid oak floor.\r\n6 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. Double Radiator. 1 TV Point. 1 Phone Point.\r\n\r\nFamily Room 11’5 x 9’7’;\r\nGas stove.\r\nSolid oak floor.\r\nUnder stairs storage.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 6 Lights (Recessed). 1 Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nGuest Bathroom 6’4’ x 4’2’;\r\n(Power) Shower, W/C, WHB.\r\nTile wall in shower area.\r\n1 Light. 1 Velux Window. 1 Towel Rail Radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Area 13’4 x 7’4’;\r\nBuilt in contemporary style kitchen wall and floor units.\r\nBreakfast counter.\r\n7 Power Points. 1 Window. 7 Lights (Recessed). 1 Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding Area;\r\nOak floor.\r\n1 Window. 1 Light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 13’2’ x 9’9;\r\nOak floor.\r\n4 Power Points. 2 Windows. 1 Light. 1 Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom 9’7’ x 5’6’;\r\nShower Cubicle (Electric Shower), W/C and WHB.\r\nTile floor and part tile walls.\r\n1 Light. 1 Velux Window. 1 Towel Rail Radiator.\r\n\r\nAttic Room - 12’3’ x 11’3; \r\nOak floor.\r\n4 Power Points. 1 Velux Window. 1 Light. 1 Double Radiator."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SERVICES:\r\nGas fired\r\nExcellent decorative order\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows\r\nConvenient location, walking distance to Cork City Centre and UCC.\r\n\r\nGUIDE PRICE €275,000\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: - Note the above particulars are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm. Every care has been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies.  All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owners for consideration"
